Your friend: Shall we do something on Saturday night? I’d love to watch a film.
You: Good idea! {{1}}
Your friend: I’d prefer the cinema. The screen is huge and the sound is amazing.
You: But {{2}}?
Your friend: Around ten euros. It’s expensive, but I think it’s worth it for a new film.
You: I see. {{3}}
Your friend: Yes, I have a subscription. We could watch a comedy at my place, but it’s not the same.
You: Well, {{4}}
Your friend: That’s true. And we could have pizza afterwards!
You: Sounds great! {{5}}?
Your friend: At eight, so we have time to buy the tickets.
You: {{6}}
